<h2>Your Password Was Reset</h2>
<p>Hi {{UserName}},</p>
<p>An administrator of your household reset the password for your Famick Home Management account.
   Your old password no longer works, and you have been signed out on every device.</p>
<p>Click the button below to choose a new password:</p>
<a href="{{ResetLink}}" class="button" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;background-color:#518751;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;margin:20px 0;font-size:15px;">Choose a New Password</a>
<p>This link expires in {{ExpiresInHours}} hours. If it expires, ask your household administrator to reset your password again.</p>
<div class="footer" style="margin-top:30px;font-size:12px;color:#666666;">
    <p>If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>
    <p>{{ResetLink}}</p>
</div>
